    <string name="device_policy_about_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="device_policy_about">When this option is enabled, RebootNya uses DevicePolicyManager for every lock-screen action, regardless of whether the current work mode is Root or Shizuku.\n\nAfter the device is locked this way, the next unlock requires the device credential. Biometric methods such as fingerprint and face unlock are temporarily unavailable. This can be useful when you need to ensure that the device cannot be unlocked with biometrics.</string>
